<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16182" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσθμ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>breathe hard:</i> used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> in pres.
			part., <i>panting,</i> as after running, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ δ᾽ ἀσθμαίνοντε κιχήτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.376
				</span></i>
			; <i>gasping for breath,</i> of one dying, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ γ᾽ ἀσθμαίνων . . ἔκπεσε δίφρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.585
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.496
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.48
			</span></i>: pres. ind., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				905b33
			</span></i>: impf., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				5.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἀσθμαίνων</span> without
				<i>an effort,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				651
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι</span>
			<i>pant for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				4.3
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πυρὸς δριμεῖαν ὁμοκλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
